        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Ensuring and embracing a workplace where all associates feel welcomed, supported, challenged and heard is an important part of how we evaluate ourselves in terms of managing our business, and developing our associates.",
        "start_character": 39132,
        "end_character": 39350
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001617406-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001617406-26-000006-3fbe453a30dc7cde",
        "accession_number": "0001617406-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For a discussion of these relationships, refer to “Risk Factors—Risks Related to Our Business and Industry—We are subject to risks associated with the employment of hotel personnel, particularly with hotels that employ unionized labor, which could increase our operating costs, reduce flexibility of our hotel managers to adjust the size of the workforce at our hotels and could materially and adversely affect our revenues and profitability.”",
        "start_character": 38145,
        "end_character": 38588
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001617406-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001617406-26-000006-3fbe453a30dc7cde",
        "accession_number": "0001617406-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are focused on consistently delivering superior risk-adjusted returns to stockholders through active asset management and a thoughtful external growth strategy, with a strategic focus on our Core portfolio, while maintaining a strong and flexible balance sheet.",
        "start_character": 758,
        "end_character": 1022
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001617406-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001617406-26-000006-3fbe453a30dc7cde",
        "accession_number": "0001617406-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We face increased competition from providers of less expensive accommodations, such as select-service hotels or independently managed hotels, during periods of economic downturn when leisure and business travelers become more sensitive to room rates.",
        "start_character": 28556,
        "end_character": 28806
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001617406-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001617406-26-000006-3fbe453a30dc7cde",
        "accession_number": "0001617406-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we have developed standardized procedures to be undertaken during and immediately following an extreme weather event or other emergency, including communication guidance, life safety and foreseen event preparedness instructions and guidance on how to manage environmental hazards, among other risk-related topics.",
        "start_character": 44428,
        "end_character": 44755
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001617406-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001617406-26-000006-3fbe453a30dc7cde",
        "accession_number": "0001617406-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we provide employees at corporate headquarters with leadership development programs, professional development training series, corporate technical “lunch and learn” trainings, REIT training, executive coaching and emotional intelligence training.",
        "start_character": 41384,
        "end_character": 41644
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001617406-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001617406-26-000006-3fbe453a30dc7cde",
        "accession_number": "0001617406-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Finally, we are focused on maintaining the competitive strength of our Core hotels and adapting to evolving customer preferences by renovating properties to provide updated guestroom design, open and activated lobby areas, food and beverage and public spaces, and modernized meeting space.",
        "start_character": 5348,
        "end_character": 5637
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001617406-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001617406-26-000006-3fbe453a30dc7cde",
        "accession_number": "0001617406-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In return, we are required to operate franchised hotels consistent with the applicable brand standards.",
        "start_character": 21967,
        "end_character": 22070
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001617406-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001617406-26-000006-3fbe453a30dc7cde",
        "accession_number": "0001617406-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our management agreements generally provide that we cannot sell a hotel to a person who (i) does not have sufficient financial resources, (ii) is of bad moral character, (iii) is a competitor of our hotel managers, or (iv) is a specially designated national or blocked person, as set forth in the applicable management agreement.",
        "start_character": 20913,
        "end_character": 21242
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001617406-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001617406-26-000006-3fbe453a30dc7cde",
        "accession_number": "0001617406-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Similarly, during times when we seek to sell hotels, competition from other sellers may increase the bargaining power of the potential property buyers.",
        "start_character": 29646,
        "end_character": 29797
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001617406-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001617406-26-000006-3fbe453a30dc7cde",
        "accession_number": "0001617406-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We aim to promote health and well-being measures in our design and construction projects through the use of natural ventilation, daylighting and air and water quality monitoring.",
        "start_character": 44095,
        "end_character": 44273
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001617406-26-000006",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001617406-26-000006-3fbe453a30dc7cde",
        "accession_number": "0001617406-26-000006",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are also party to certain leases for facilities related to certain hotels owned by us.",
